The `CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_TERMINAL_TITLE` property still doesn't work for me. My settings.json file looks like this:

```
{
  "env": {
    "CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_TERMINAL_TITLE": "1"
  }
}
```

